## 1. Scope

This reference covers insulation tubes formed from polyester film, the Mylar type material. The grade is chosen where the temperature class allows it and the cost of a fluoropolymer or polyimide tube is not justified.

## 2. Construction

- Tube formed from polyester film, supplied in continuous lengths or cut to size.
- Wall thickness set by film gauge and construction.
- Used as a lead covering, a winding liner or a general electrical insulation sleeve.
- Semi-transparent in thin gauges.

